 "text": "Voltage variators - Adjustable autotransformers\n\nTorivac designs and manufactures voltage and stepless variable speed drives for precise, safe and reliable control of electrical systems in industrial, technical and laboratory environments. Our range of solutions is designed to adapt to both standard applications and specific requirements, always guaranteeing stable operation in compliance with current safety regulations.\n\nAdjustment accessories allow for convenient and safe adjustment of the variable voltage drive, facilitating its integration into different systems and enhancing the equipment’s user experience. These complementary elements are designed to optimize handling, user protection and operating efficiency.\n\nFor applications requiring a ready-to-use solution, Torivac supplies benchtop units mounted in enclosures with IP20 or IP65 protection ratings. These units allow immediate commissioning, avoiding contact with live parts of the circuit and offering a compact and safe solution for environments where no additional development is required. \n\nExplore subcategories\nCustom manufacturing\nEach customer is unique, and therefore there are nuances or variations of standard products that they require. In TORIVAC we make adaptations of products to make it YOUR product, from a longer shaft to be able to install the voltage variator at the bottom of a cabinet, special motorizations in direct current or three-phase, specific display elements, special sizes. Fixings adapted to your system, etc. Do not hesitate to contact us and we will propose you the optimal solution.\nLearn more\nRegulating accessories\nWe have all the necessary accessories to carry out the regulation of your voltage variator in a comfortable, safe and adapted way to your needs.\nLearn more\nSingle Phase Inverters\nThe single-phase AC drives are designed to work with a supply voltage of 230VAC. The output voltage can be regulated from 0-230VAC. Upon request or order, we can manufacture single-phase voltage inverters with regulation up to 0-260VAC as standard, or with mains supply at 127VAC or 400VAC. Likewise, we can manufacture voltage variators with any range of regulation and power.\nLearn more\nThree-phase drives\nThe standard three-phase AC drives are designed to work with a 3 x 400VAC power supply, allowing the output voltage to be regulated from 3 x 0-400VAC. On request we manufacture three-phase AC drives with regulation up to 3 x 0-450VAC as standard, with mains supply at 2 x 230VAC and special voltages. In the same way, we can manufacture drives with any voltage and power range.\nLearn more\nDesktop equipment\nEquipment in IP20 – IP65 enclosure. All our inverters can be supplied as a complete enclosed unit. Designed for those customers who only need to connect them and start working with them in a safe way, avoiding contact with live parts of the circuit and always under the current safety regulations.\nLearn more\nDouble Variator\nThe dual mounting system is commonly used to double the power of the equipment without increasing the plant dimensions. For 400V power supply or to be used as phase inverter regulators in voltage stabilizers. Manufactured with the same coils with which we manufacture single-phase drives, their power supply and regulation range will vary according to the type of connection used. On request we manufacture single-phase voltage variators with regulation up to 2 X 0-260 as standard, or with 127VAC or 400VAC mains power supply. In the same way, it is possible to produce voltage variators with any range of regulation…\nLearn more\n\nTorivac-Products\n\n×\n\nProducts\n\nTransformers\n\n+\n\nConventional transformer\n\nToroidal transformers\n\nVoltage variators - Adjustable autotransformers\n\n+\n\nCustom manufacturing\n\nDesktop equipment\n\nDouble Variator\n\nRegulating accessories\n\nSingle Phase Inverters\n\nThree-phase drives\n\nVoltage stabilizers\n\n+\n\nAVS Series Stabilizers: electromechanical with servo motor\n\nBAVS Series: Electronics\n\nRheostats and coiled potentiometers\n\n+\n\nCeramic rheostats\n\nPotentiometers\n\nEncapsulated coils\n\n+\n\nRound\n\nSquares\n\nChokes | Inductances | Toroidal Reactances\n\n+\n\nNuclei\n\n+\n\nPortaled\n\n+\n\nled 10mm\n\nled 3mm\n\nled 5mm\n\nled 8mm\n\nSockets\n\n+\n\nHB4 socket\n\nHSR4 safety socket\n\nSafety socket HBS4\n\nsafety socket HR4\n\nControl buttons\n\n+\n\nArrow Discs\n\nArrow hoops\n\nBM series control buttons (Matte)\n\nBM Series Covers\n\nBO series control buttons (bright)\n\nBO Series control buttons with line\n\nBO series covers\n\nCasing covers\n\nEstators\n\nGraded covers\n\nGraduated discs\n\nResistors : Load banks\n\n+\n\nBoxed\n\nBraking resistors\n\nCemented\n\nGrounding resistors\n\nHelical\n\nLoad banks\n\nStarting resistors\n\nElectronic equipment\n\n+\n\nConverters\n\nDC power supplies\n\nIndustrial control\n\nRenewable energies",
